      "answer": {
        "answer": "While the AI RMF can be used to prioritize risk, it does not prescribe risk tolerance. Risk tolerance and the level of risk that is acceptable to organizations or society are highly contextual and application and use-case specific. Furthermore, risk tolerance can be influenced by legal or regulatory requirements, as well as by policies and norms established by AI system owners, organizations, industries, communities, or policy makers.",
